cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PASR in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "PASR — Provenance-Aware Span Recall"
abstract: >-
  Local, token-budgeted, source-traceable context for coding agents. Selects source
  spans for a query and records their file:line provenance, token accounting, and
  retrieval signals in recoverable receipts. The budget covers rendered context,
  not the complete model conversation; routing advice is heuristic, not a
  correctness guarantee. Selection is offline by default.
type: software
authors:
